{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は チャリティーイベント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いま、私たちにできること」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天候が悪くて寒かった中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅう、ひめたんが欠席で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"31人でのライブになったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 全員で気持ちを一つにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このライブに臨みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ 白い雲に乗って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ 会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ 左胸の勇気"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ 失いたくないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ 乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6曲 全て披露させていただき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームに別れてメンバー全員のトーク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私の笑顔の素」というテーマで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれがトークをして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさたちのチームは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族について話しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地震が起きた当時は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちは 普通の女の子でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今は乃木坂46として"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルとして たくさんの人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔や元気やパワーを与えられる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな存在になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちの笑顔、パワーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北のみなさんに届いたかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも私に出来ること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちにしかできないこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を精一杯やっていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のイベントを通して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に協力してくださった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファミリーのみなさんのことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと大好きになった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのことがだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ未熟者で微力な私達ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分けて書きたかったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日書くより、今日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんに今の気持ちを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話ししたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組を見てくださった方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうご存知だと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドシングル選抜メンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、選ばれませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「次は うれし涙を見せたい」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言って涙を流しませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのにうれし涙ではなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しい涙を流してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この放送を見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また泣いてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいというより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく悲しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛い気持ちの方が大きかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれし涙をみせるといったのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約束を守れずごめんなさい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンでデビューして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまで結成されてから毎日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にレッスンもしてきたのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、だんだん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケジュールも違くなってきて.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜が仕事の間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーだけでひたすら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスレッスンをする日もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休みの日もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビをつけたら乃木坂が出ていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で、1人見ている日もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自然と涙が出てきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、すごく悔しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に辛かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分も、ステージに立ちたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど選抜のみんなも頑張りよん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対絶対 めっちゃ緊張してるやろうに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔で一生懸命頑張りよん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"複雑な気持ちでだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーみんなで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「絶対に選抜入ろうね」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励まし合って頑張ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は私。って本当は思いたいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなの個性が光っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で 自分ってなんなんやろう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にしかないものってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これといった個性がないよな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにが足りない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日 考えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも辛くても 頑張るしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力を続けるしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下に居るのなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上に上にと、上がっていくために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人一倍努力するしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに辛くても悔しくても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが自分で選んだ道だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思わせてくれたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの大きな支えになっているからです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさにはたくさんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさをいつも想ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれて 支えてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励ましてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔と元気をくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かい、みなさんがいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の選抜落ちたときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん応援コメントを頂いたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で会ったとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日の中でそう思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜みたいにメディアにたくさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出られるわけじゃないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさのことを知ってもらうには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やライブで頑張るしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんこのblogでも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直接みなさんにお会いしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからみさにとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回一回の握手会やライブが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大切で 本当に楽しみでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく応援してくれているのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの期待に答えられず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな、まだまだ努力が足りない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っていても結果が出ないということは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ頑張りが足りないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、私これからも毎日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までと変わることなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、今までよりもっともっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで腐るわけにはいきません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこれからも みさのことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援していただけますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に絶対に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさを推してきてよかった。って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にもっともっと頑張るから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が暗くてずっと落ち込んでいては"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんもきっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ気持ちになると思うんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で会ったとき何て言おう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこと考えないでくださいね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさはもう元気です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも通り 笑顔なみさみさで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待っていますから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間が始まります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも一緒に、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりかもしれないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"険しい道かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまだ先の見えない坂だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に坂を登ってほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/9523368/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012-3-19      衛藤美彩。"}],"source":"archive"}